      <h2>A little about me</h2>
      <p>I write about scientific methodology, philosophy, economics and contemporary global politics, while also writing and publishing poetry.</p>
      <p>I currently serve as Chief Publications Officer at Turkey's Unheard Voices. I have previously published in EconomiCAL and GündemX, and my poetry has appeared in Dil ve Edebiyat Dergisi and Olağan Şiir Dergisi.</p>
      <p>I am also deeply involved in Model United Nations. I served as Secretary-General of the Yeşilköy Anatolian High School MUN Club for a year and currently take on executive roles such as Head of Academy and Head of Crisis at various MUN conferences.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="quote">I am particularly interested in the decentralised structure of knowledge, and in exploring to what extent scientific principles can effectively guide the study of human affairs.</div>
