      <p class="section-intro">These are not meant as fixed academic labels; they are the questions and traditions I currently return to most often.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-2">
      <div class="card"><h3>Knowledge &amp; Method</h3><p>Epistemology, philosophy of science, scientific methodology, objectivity, evidence and the limits of methods.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Politics &amp; Conflict</h3><p>History and contemporary conflict zones, global politics, institutions, legitimacy and political crises.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Economics</h3><p>Macroeconomics, expectations, monetary policy and the relationship between institutions and economic behaviour.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Literature &amp; Religion</h3><p>Modern Turkish literature, poetry and religious studies, especially where ideas and human experience intersect.</p></div>
